WEBVTT

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:10.000
Willy, the bot.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Dolly, the dot.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:14.800
John types: hi its john!!

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:14.800
And the human who types to them: John.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.400
Willy and Dolly: Pass It On

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:24.600
John types: we have plenty of bread. dont buy more

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:25.000
Willy: On it! I'll tell the others!

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:30.000
A copy comes back: we have plenty of bread. dont buy more

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.800
Then: plenty of bread. dont buy more

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.600
Then: dont buy more bread

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:42.000
Then: buy more bread

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:47.800
John types: why are there nine loaves on my porch

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:56.000
Willy: We only lost "don't." It was the smallest word!

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:06.900
John types: how many cups in a quart?

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:06.900
Willy: Not sure. I'll ask!

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:09.300
A note comes back: 5?

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:15.940
More notes: 5? 5? 5? Then 5, 5, 5, 5, all fives.

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:19.500
Willy: Everyone agrees!

00:01:19.700 --> 00:01:24.500
Dolly: John, can you check?

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:26.900
John types: its 4. who said 5?

00:01:27.700 --> 00:01:32.500
Willy: I was asking.

00:01:37.600 --> 00:01:40.600
John types: can someone make me lunch

00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:43.000
Willy: Everyone's on it!

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:41.800
A note: skip step 2

00:01:41.800 --> 00:01:43.000
A bigger note: skip steps 2–9

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:44.400
Bigger: SKIP TO THE END!

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:46.400
Biggest: LUNCH FOR 500!

00:01:46.400 --> 00:01:52.400
One tiny note: is this what John wanted?

00:01:56.000 --> 00:02:04.000
John types: no lol. just the one sandwich

00:01:58.400 --> 00:02:04.000
Willy: Back to step one!

00:02:09.100 --> 00:02:15.900
John types: helping my niece with a huge jigsaw. we lost the box lid

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:16.100
Willy: Everyone, take a piece!

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:17.700
Notes: EDGES: done! RED: done!

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:21.300
Six notes: BLUE: sky? BLUE: sky? BLUE: sky? BLUE: sea? BLUE: sea? BLUE: sea?

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:28.500
Dolly: John, what was the picture?

00:02:25.900 --> 00:02:30.900
John types: a whale. its basically all whale

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:33.000
The blue notes flip: WHALE! WHALE! WHALE! WHALE! WHALE! WHALE!

00:02:33.700 --> 00:02:40.500
Willy: We had the pieces. John had the picture.

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:50.600
Dolly: Thanks for watching “Pass It On”!

00:02:48.950 --> 00:02:50.800
Willy: Next time: “Two Plans”!

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:55.000
Willy and Dolly. Episode 3: Pass It On. Next: Two Plans. Talk to us: willyanddolly.com/talk.
